'''Steel Apron''' (Japanese: '''鋼鉄のまえかけ''' ''Steel Apron'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=The {{e|Metal}} Pokémon this card is attached to takes −10 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon, recovers from all Special Conditions, and can't be affected by any Special Conditions.
